span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_d, B_d, K_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别是期望的虚拟质量、阻尼、刚度矩阵。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 调大，机械臂&quot;硬&quot;，接近位置控制；调小则&quot;软&quot;，接触时温柔退让。这组参数可在线调节，甚至按方向各异——这正是阻抗控制比纯位控优越之处：同一控制律既能精确定位又能柔顺接触。它的物理基础是<a href=\"../grasp-mechanics/contact-friction-models\">接触模型与摩擦锥</a>里 Hertz 接触给出的接触刚度，虚拟刚度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与真实接触刚度共同决定接触力大小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阻抗与导纳的对偶\">阻抗与导纳的对偶</h2><p>阻抗控制和导纳控制是一对&quot;因果对偶&quot;，区别在内外环结构。<strong>阻抗控制</strong>以位置为输入、力为输出：测量位置偏差，按弹簧阻尼律算出该施加的力，适合本身能精确输出力矩的机器人（如直驱、低减速比协作臂）。<strong>导纳控制</strong>反过来，以力为输入、位置为输出：测量接触力，按导纳律算出应该让到哪个位置，再交给底层高刚度位置控制器执行，适合本身刚度高、难直接控力的工业臂。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>阻抗控制</th>\n<th>导纳控制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入→输出</td>\n<td>位置偏差 → 力</td>\n<td>测量力 → 位移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底层控制器</td>\n<td>力矩/电流</td>\n<td>高刚度位置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合机器人</td>\n<td>低惯量、可控力矩</td>\n<td>高刚度工业臂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接触稳定性</td>\n<td>软接触稳</td>\n<td>硬接触稳、软接触易震荡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选错会出问题：导纳控制在接触很软的环境（如海绵）易因力测量噪声放大而震荡，阻抗控制在极硬环境则可能因力矩带宽不足而不稳。实战按机器人本体和接触环境刚度匹配选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"力-力矩感知与混合控制\">力/力矩感知与混合控制</h2><p>力控离不开力感知。来源有三：腕部六维<strong>力/力矩传感器</strong>（最准、最贵）、关节力矩传感器（协作臂常配）、以及无传感器的<strong>电机电流估力</strong>（便宜但含摩擦噪声）。装配类任务对力精度要求高，通常用腕部传感器。</p>\n<p><strong>混合力/位控</strong>（Raibert-Craig）用一个选择矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 把任务空间分解：受约束方向用力控，自由方向用位控。轴孔装配是经典例子——轴向（插入方向）用力控保持温柔接触、避免卡死，径向与姿态用位控对准孔位：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mi>S</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{\\tau} = J^\\top\\big[ S\\,\\vec{F}_{force} + (I - S)\\,\\vec{F}_{pos} \\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3163em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3163em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">os</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>接触任务还有一个鲁棒性利器是<strong>重映射式探索</strong>与<strong>柔顺装配策略</strong>，让机器人在力反馈引导下&quot;摸索&quot;对准，容忍感知误差。这也是 2025 年许多模仿学习方法引入力觉的动机——Haptic-ACT 加入力/力矩输入做抓取失败检测与自适应重试，在精细操作上取得约 80% 成功率，详见<a href=\"../learning-manipulation/imitation-learning\">模仿学习与示教</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"力控在抓取系统中的位置\">力控在抓取系统中的位置</h2><p>力控是抓取流程的&quot;接触段大脑&quot;。前面的<a href=\"trajectory-planning\">轨迹规划与避障</a>在自由空间快速接近，临接触时切到力控/柔顺；闭合夹爪时控制夹持力避免压碎；提起、插入、放置等接触密集动作全程靠柔顺保护。它把刚性的位置世界与柔软的接触世界缝合起来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[轨迹规划 自由空间接近] --&gt; B[检测接触/降速]&#10;    B --&gt; C[切换阻抗/力控]&#10;    C --&gt; D[闭合夹爪 控制夹持力]&#10;    D --&gt; E[提起: 阻抗保护]&#10;    E --&gt; F{需精密接触?}&#10;    F --&gt;|插孔/装配| G[混合力位控]&#10;    F --&gt;|搬运| H[低刚度阻抗]&#10;    G --&gt; I[力反馈摸索对准]\">flowchart TD\n    A[轨迹规划 自由空间接近] --&gt; B[检测接触/降速]\n    B --&gt; C[切换阻抗/力控]\n    C --&gt; D[闭合夹爪 控制夹持力]\n    D --&gt; E[提起: 阻抗保护]\n    E --&gt; F{需精密接触?}\n    F --&gt;|插孔/装配| G[混合力位控]\n    F --&gt;|搬运| H[低刚度阻抗]\n    G --&gt; I[力反馈摸索对准]</pre><p>随着学习方法兴起，柔顺与力控正被融入端到端策略——<a href=\"../learning-manipulation/rl-grasping\">强化学习抓取策略</a>可在仿真中学出隐式柔顺，<a href=\"../learning-manipulation/vla-models\">VLA 模型</a>的 π0 系列用流匹配输出高频动作实现闭环柔顺。但显式阻抗控制因其可调、可证、安全，仍是接触任务的工程基石。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>接触任务用纯位置控制会产生危险接触力；力控与柔顺控制让机器人在接触中懂得退让。</li>\n<li>阻抗控制让末端表现为虚拟质量—阻尼—弹簧系统，刚度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可调，既能定位又能柔顺，物理基础是 <a href=\"../grasp-mechanics/contact-friction-models\">Hertz 接触刚度</a>。</li>\n<li>阻抗与导纳是因果对偶：阻抗（位置→力）适合低惯量可控力矩机器人，导纳（力→位置）适合高刚度工业臂，选错会震荡。</li>\n<li>力感知来自腕部传感器、关节力矩或电流估力；混合力/位控用选择矩阵分方向控制，是轴孔装配的标准。</li>\n<li>力控是抓取流程的接触段大脑，承接<a href=\"trajectory-planning\">轨迹规划</a>，并正被<a href=\"../learning-manipulation/rl-grasping\">强化学习</a>与<a href=\"../learning-manipulation/vla-models\">VLA 模型</a>融入端到端策略。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"力控与柔顺控制","id":"力控与柔顺控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"阻抗控制：让机械臂像弹簧","id":"阻抗控制-让机械臂像弹簧"},{"level":2,"text":"阻抗与导纳的对偶","id":"阻抗与导纳的对偶"},{"level":2,"text":"力/力矩感知与混合控制","id":"力-力矩感知与混合控制"},{"level":2,"text":"力控在抓取系统中的位置","id":"力控在抓取系统中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"轨迹规划与避障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/planning-control/trajectory-planning"},"next":{"title":"模仿学习与示教","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/robotic-manipulation/learning-manipulation/imitation-learning"}}